OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 1 APR
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GLinton Stephens introduces an
OL,6,     Gafternoon of specially made
OL,7,     Grecordings, including sacred
OL,8,     Gmusic by Bach and Haydn and
OL,9,     Grecent chamber music recordings
OL,10,     Gfrom the Crucible, Sheffield.
OL,11,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,12,     GLive from Newcastle Cathedral for
OL,13,     Gthe Wednesday in Holy Week, with
OL,14,     Gmusic by Gesualdo, Eriks
OL,15,     GEsenvalds, Dvorak and Dupre.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: Hildegard
OL,17,     Fof Bingen and Isabella Leonarda
OL,18,     GHildegard becomes a leader and
OL,19,     Gstrikes out on her own. With
OL,20,     GDonald Macleod.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
