OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 1 APR
OL,4,G1700FIn Tune
OL,5,     GKatie Derham presents live music
OL,6,     Gfrom pianist Libby Burgess,
OL,7,     Gcellist Cara Berridge and
OL,8,     Gviolinist Sophie Rosa. Katie also
OL,9,     Ginterviews the directors of the
OL,10,     Gnew QueerScore festival.
OL,11,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,12,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,13,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,14,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,15,     GAlina Ibragimova is the soloist
OL,16,     Gin Bartok's Violin Concerto No.
OL,17,     G1, and Edward Gardner conducts
OL,18,     Gthe London Philharmonic Orchestra
OL,19,     Gin Mussorgsky's Pictures at an
OL,20,     GExhibition.
